      "ref": "L009"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R002",
      "order": 2,
      "text": "*FOCUS dataset* MUST adhere to the following *custom column* presence requirements:",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Dataset Completeness",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 11,
        "line_end": 11
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L011"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R003",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "*FOCUS dataset* MUST include *custom columns* (e.g., `x_ChargeSubType`) needed to support [*invoice reconciliation*](#glossary:invoice-reconciliation) when the [*invoice issuer*](#glossary:invoice-issuer) supports payable invoices, and when *FOCUS columns* are not sufficient.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Dataset Completeness",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 1,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 12,
        "line_end": 12
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L012"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R004",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "*FOCUS dataset* MUST include *custom columns* corresponding to [*native dataset*](#glossary:native-dataset) columns, except those explicitly listed as exclusions with justification in publicly-available documentation, provided those excluded columns are unrelated to *invoice reconciliation*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Dataset Completeness",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 1,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 13,
        "line_end": 13
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L013"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "*FOCUS dataset* MUST have all included *custom columns* documented in publicly-available documentation, including description, purpose, and relationship to *native dataset* columns.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Dataset Completeness",
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 1,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
