    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "*FOCUS dataset* MUST NOT alter the aggregated values of summable [*metrics*](#glossary:metric) (e.g., costs and quantities) due to the inclusion of *custom columns*.",
